"1" Enter               # /1
Enter*5                 # report:/1 report: report:/1 report: /2
Enter*3                 # exec report:/1 report:
Enter                   # /3
Up Up*22 Esc "e"        # at /4, review to /1 Done and edit
Backspace "2" Enter     # /1 seeded 1
Enter*7                 # report:/1 report: report:/1 report: /2 /4 survey:
